libloc
------------------------------------------
Library to determine the location of someone on the Internet

Runtime requirements:
  bash-5.2.21-1
  cygwin-3.6.11-1
  libloc-devel-0.9.19-1bl1
  libloc1-0.9.19-1bl1
  liblua5.3-5.3.6-4
  libssl3-3.5.9-1
  perl-libloc-0.9.19-1bl1
  perl_base-5.44.0-1
  pkg-config-3.0.9-1
  python3-3.12.12-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  asciidoc-10.2.1-1
  autoconf-20260320-3
  automake-20260320-2
  binutils-2.47-1
  cygport-0.37.11-1
  gcc-core-14.4.0-1
  gettext-devel-0.22.5-1
  intltool-0.51.0-1
  liblua-devel-5.3.6-4
  libssl-devel-3.5.9-1
  libtool-2.6.2-1
  make-4.4.1-2
  perl-5.44.0-1
  python3-3.12.12-1
  python3-devel-3.12.12-1

Canonical website:
  https://www.ipfire.org/location/

Canonical download:
  https://source.ipfire.org/releases/libloc/libloc-0.9.19.tar.gz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack libloc-0.9.19-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./libloc-0.9.19-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/libloc-0.9.19-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libloc-0.9.19-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libloc1-0.9.19-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libloc-devel-0.9.19-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/lua-libloc-0.9.19-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/perl-libloc-0.9.19-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/python312-libloc-0.9.19-X.tar.xz

